                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: Nteeranira abantu makumi mushanju omu bakuru b'Abaisraeli, abu orikumanya ngu n'abakuru b'abantu, n'abategyeki baabo, obareete aha Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, beemerereho naiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.10.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 10:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naanye niinyija kushuuma, ngambireyo naiwe; nyihe aha mwoyo oguri ahariiwe, ngubateho; nabo bagume baheekye naiwe omutwaro gw'abo bantu, orekye kuguheeka wenka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 7:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi ogambire abantu oti: Mweyeze ahabw'eizooba rya nyencakare, nimwija kurya enyama; ahakuba muririire omu matu ga MUKAMA, nimugira muti: N'oha oraatuhe enyama y'okurya? Ahakuba tukaba turi gye omuri Misri. N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA naija kubaha enyama, nimugirya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timurigirya izooba rimwe, nari amazooba abiri, nari ataano nari ikumi nari makumi abiri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kureka nimwija kugirya okwezi kwona, okuhitsya obu eribareetwa omu nyindo, ekabatama; ahabw'okuba mugayire MUKAMA ori omuriimwe, mwamuririra omumaisho nimugira muti: Tukaba twarugira ki Misri? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaagira ati: Abantu abu ntuuramu n'abashaija obusiriira mukaaga abarikugyendesa ebigyere; kandi waagira oti: Niinyija kubaha enyama, bagirye okumara okwezi kwona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.7.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 7:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.15.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 15:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nibaija kubaagirwa amasyo g'entaama n'ag'ente g'okubahaazya? Nari shi eby'enyanja byona nibiija kuteeranirwa hamwe ahabw'abo kubahaazya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.50.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 50:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.12.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 12:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Noogira ngu omukono gwa MUKAMA gubaire mugufu? Mbwenu noija kureeba ekigambo kyangye ku kiraabe nikiija kuhikiirira ahabwawe nari kitarikwija kubakwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
